sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor V as Visitor
  participant B as Browser (ContactForm)
  participant TS as Cloudflare Turnstile
  participant S as Server handler (Server Action / Route Handler)
  participant RS as Resend API
  participant M as Owner inbox

  V->>B: Fill fields
  B->>TS: Render widget, run challenge
  TS-->>B: token
  V->>B: Submit
  B->>B: Client Zod validation
  alt invalid
    B-->>V: Field errors, focus first invalid
  else valid
    B->>S: POST {name, email, type, message, consent, token, honeypot, renderedAt}
    S->>S: Reject if honeypot filled or submitted < 3 s
    S->>S: Server Zod validation + strip CR/LF from header fields
    S->>TS: siteverify(secret, token, remoteip)
    TS-->>S: success / failure
    alt verification failed
      S-->>B: 400 {error: "verification_failed"}
      B-->>V: Error state + retry
    else verified
      S->>RS: send(from, to, replyTo=email, subject, text)
      alt send ok
        RS-->>S: 200 {id}
        S-->>B: 200 {ok: true}
        B-->>V: MESSAGE RECEIVED
        RS->>M: Deliver email
      else provider error
        RS-->>S: 4xx/5xx
        S->>S: Log error code only (no message body)
        S-->>B: 502 {error: "delivery_failed"}
        B-->>V: Error + direct email link
      end
    end
  end
